{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-06_beg","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-06","title":"平議生死","storyCode":"12-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-06_beg.txt","sourceHash":"18a2da1e5558630eccca272f4f65fd39de341d53314a7fb436071edd9a362326","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"善良的明椒在混亂中給諾伯特區的薩卡茲酒店經理送去食物。Logos與變形者集群展開了關於文明與生存的辯論。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g1_glasgowboxinggym"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"別過來，你們別過來！"},{"type":"narration","text":"這個瘦小的男人突然拿出了個什麼東西在空中揮舞著，是一支鋼筆，就算是在黑暗中，也能看清楚它上面的華貴裝飾。\n這位自稱能成為下個皇家科學院院士的紋章學家或許曾用它寫下不少精彩的考據。\n然而如今，它成了個可憐的，十足不體面的武器，被顫抖地握在掌中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"噹啷一聲，一個罐頭從男人的大衣裡滑落，男人慌忙彎腰撿起，又藏回自己的衣擺下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先生，那是我們最後一個肉罐頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，我堅持不下去了。我快被逼瘋了！這片封鎖區，這些飄在空氣中的死人粉塵，這些屍體的臭味，這一切——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白，我為什麼要過這樣的日子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我該是個有身份的人！我該在羽獸的鳴叫中醒來，喝一杯咖啡，然後去寫我的書稿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我為什麼——女士們，我很抱歉，你們幫了我很多，可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"請原諒我，請原諒我，我不該做這樣的事，我曾以我的道德自豪，我對我的傭人很好，每次在外面吃飯我都給雙倍的小費......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我堅持不住了，我真是受夠了，我不明白，我很困惑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可以放下手中的罐頭，然後離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以和你們交換！我有些薩爾貢的寶石，還有一把薩科塔的守護銃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們用不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"膽怯的市民","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我求求你們，我求求你們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這位先生抖得愈來愈厲害，最終雙膝一軟，跪在了地上。他大概從來沒有這麼哀求過別人，姿勢滑稽而可笑。\n他緊緊地裹住自己的大衣，藏著肉罐頭的位置鼓出一塊，像是個寄居在身體上的悲哀腫瘤，又像是個備受愛惜的胎兒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，先生，正門被封上了，你知道怎麼從陽台出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他走吧，讓他走吧！滾出這裡，帶著這個該死的罐頭，再也別回來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我很累，我不想再看到這些了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的......不想再看到這一切了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"膽怯的市民慌亂地起身，他踉蹌著，猶豫著，彷彿不相信這位經營拳館的幫派分子就這麼放任自己離去。\n戴菲恩憤怒地看著他，他別過頭，下意識地在身上摸索著。他什麼也沒有，鈔票和硬幣在現在的諾伯特區毫無用處。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這位先生咬咬牙，把自己那支裝飾精美的鋼筆放在了地上，隨即轉身逃進黑暗裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"貝爾德撿起鋼筆，隨手放進自己的口袋。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......戴菲恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們靠著，眯一會吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像那些日子，在影廳裡一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g5_blockadewall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，聽說你是新被調來的雇傭兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"那你運氣不錯，這裡可是個輕鬆的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"只要看著那些維多利亞佬別翻過封鎖線就行。要是有人敢鬧事，就幹掉他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！這幫傲慢自大的維多利亞人也該過過苦日子啦！要我說，不如再給他們幾把斧頭什麼的，他們自己就能把自己殺光了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......這好像不符合規定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"丫頭，你真夠沒意思的。我們是薩卡茲，他們的死活和我們又有什麼關係？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不如給自己找點樂子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"算了吧，我去再睡一會，好好看住這裡。要是出了什麼意外，我也不介意連著你的那顆小腦袋瓜一起砍掉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次我帶出來的東西不多，有些吃的，還有些藥......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足夠了，謝謝，謝謝......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個薩卡茲，幫你應該沒什麼關係吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我們的同族......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老人家，也許我們可以去和長官們說一聲，你不用和那些維多利亞人待在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不了，我在這裡生活了一輩子，這裡是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在倫蒂尼姆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡都有薩卡茲，不是嗎？在你們來倫蒂尼姆之後，我還當上了酒店經理呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒去過卡茲戴爾，小姑娘，你是從那裡來的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我也沒去過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你的家是哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家？我......我不清楚，我出生在哥倫比亞，可是......我以前的隊長說，卡茲戴爾才是我們薩卡茲的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你明明都沒去過那裡呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我也不知道，但他們都這麼說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我對那些士兵們宣揚的東西沒那麼感興趣，與其和他們一起殺人，我寧願想辦法修好酒店裡的那盞大吊燈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真該看看那盞吊燈還完好時候的樣子，要我說，沒有一位貴婦人的首飾能比得上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何況，我年輕的時候，每天都要花好多功夫親手把它擦亮呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您還真是個奇怪的薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喜歡吊燈比喜歡殺人還要奇怪嗎？抱歉，我確實沒怎麼和雇傭兵打過交道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，有你這樣好心的姑娘為我帶些物資進來，我就已經心滿意足啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再會吧，孩子，我不能在這裡待太久，如果以後有機會，你一定要來我的酒店看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在三四十年前，諾伯特區還熱鬧的時候，日落街酒店可是全倫蒂尼姆最好的住處！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......等到打完這場仗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好，到時候我偷偷請你吃我們那裡最棒的甜品！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"破碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種咒術對於我們而言沒什麼意義，女妖。這些日子裡，你已經試了足夠多次了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是浪費時間，你並不真正瞭解我們的集群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的知識都是從學習中得來，但切身的經驗卻太少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然，暫且放下你那支骨筆如何？我們只是想和你散散步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位我們曾化身的子爵先生說過，如今是這座城市最好的時節之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走慢些，中央區的這些行道樹可是倫蒂尼姆的驕傲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"變形者，你到底想為自己選擇何種命運？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有很多化身，你有很多變體，你以為自己總能逃過死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會奏響你的挽歌，全部的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用這麼嚇唬人，女妖，我們清楚你有哪些手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，對於我們而言，個體的死亡不是終結，如同一座城市不會因某條街道的拆除而變質，一個文明不會因某行文字的消失而崩塌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而文明亦會凋敝衰落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我們重視更新，重視經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們認識你的幾乎每一位先祖，女妖，他們都曾年輕過，都曾和你一樣懷有巨大的熱忱與希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許本應如此，或許變革本就該從挽歌中而生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他們最終都化為了一抔塵土。你們亦無法逃過背後的喪鐘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的經驗依舊把你引向了那團毀滅的火焰身邊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經尋找了很多年，我們仍在尋找，以不同的樣子，在不同的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一位了不起的咒術大師。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"變形者集群","speakerId":"avg_npc_426_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是否能邀請你，為這份長久的回憶提供些微不足道的佈景呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"我們......我曾在薩爾貢的沙海中沉淪百年，那是萬王之王的遠征剛剛結束的年月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"偉業尚未徹底淪為傳說之時，總是更讓人想要涉足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"女妖，縱使是幻境，吹起那些風沙吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"耽誤你片刻微不足道的時間，與我尋找我的來路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們沉入其中，讓我們一同跋涉。也許你會理解我，抑或我會認同你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"證明給我看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會有結論的，變形者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帷幕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，當然，這與我殘存記憶中的樣子有些出入，這不能怪你，風會刮走太多痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾在這裡為人們蓋房子，那時還沒有移動城市這種新奇玩意，石頭壘成的房屋最終也無非消散於風沙之間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"建起，再毀滅，建起，再毀滅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"大多數人面對這種迴圈可能會感到疲憊，但那時我樂在其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾自比於文明，這是你所享受的“更新”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我並不享受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"那只是個潦草的比喻，文明終究會有其構建，有其結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"而我並不擁有這些，縱使我如此期冀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是石頭，你是黃沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"......黃沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"對，女妖，我是黃沙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無可構建，已是結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_650_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不滿足於此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾化為王酋的樣貌，面見過當時的那位萬王之王，他自稱“過去與未來之王”，萬事萬物的答案都在他的黃金寶庫之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"我問：陛下，我們身邊這一切的意義是什麼，您會把我們領向何方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"他高高昂起頭顱，向我聲稱：我的思索就是意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"他是那麼驕傲，那麼狂妄，他的身上灑滿午後的陽光，他相信自己是文明的主宰者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"我卻只看到，他滑稽地踩住了自己長袍的一角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“薩爾貢人”","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"我感到無聊，於是我離開了那裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵們的手段讓我印象深刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這支小隊的人並不算少......然而你們潛入這裡簡直就像走入自家的後院一樣容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的那些快速牽引裝置，還有小型的幻術發生單元......難怪在薩卡茲如此嚴密的控制下，你們仍然能在倫蒂尼姆搭建自己的情報網。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乃至可以在倫蒂尼姆和這個被拋離的地塊之間來去自如。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞是這片大地上最強大的國家，而我效忠的那位公爵閣下又是維多利亞最值得被提及的一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們自然會給自己準備好各種技術手段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"希望這些手段不會用在我們身上。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開斯特公爵對待她的朋友總是親切的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"飛空艇就藏在這片地塊中的某個位置，據我們的估計，這裡應該有一座地下船塢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更具體的情報呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就交給各位了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在老威靈頓和那位食腐者將軍試探出彼此的實力之前，你們還有一點時間，但恐怕也說不上多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信各位最後能給我一個滿意的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別忘了，這是場交易，亞歷山德莉娜殿下，還有羅德島的博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
